### Analysis of CubeSat Components System-Level Relationships

The CubeSat components including the 'Spacecraft', 'GNC Subsystem', 'Propulsion Subsystem', 'Power Subsystem', 'Reaction Wheel', and 'GNC Software', each play a pivotal role in the functioning and success of a CubeSat mission. Understanding the interactions among these components requires a detailed analysis:

